From 26e293d0aba4a32807c9001bd939b0351f161b57 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 09:24:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Bigger hero text, 3-col careers grid, real address

Increase font sizes for the About/Careers hero eyebrow, badges
("6 open disciplines", location, "Apply by email"), and the careers
card action text. Switch the careers grid to a fixed 3-column layout
(2 then 1 column on smaller screens). Add V-Chip's Penang office
address and a Google Maps link to the About page's "Our Penang
presence" card, and correct the hero location badges on both pages
from the placeholder "Bayan Lepas" to Gelugor.

Extend the existing content-reveal system (site.js/styles.css) to
also cover the About/Careers hero eyebrow, badge row, and button row,
instead of adding a second parallel reveal mechanism -- scoped to 1s
via --motion-reveal on .page-hero-video so the hero cascades in
quickly while the rest of the site keeps its slower pace.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SjcntVjf5Nr2bdomgFdfPu
